# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Houses of Hermes: Mystery Cults — House Merinita (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** Houses of Hermes: Mystery Cults (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Chapter One (pp. 7–43)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> Chapter One’s narrative, verbatim: House Merinita’s history from Birna to the present,
> its customs, the six clans and their septs, the Merinita Council, the Heartbeast and its
> Inner Mysteries, and the Huntress in the Wood. Mechanics are records elsewhere:
